   "title": "Flipped sex roles in pipefish, seahorse topic of U of I research",
   "date": "2020-10-21",
   "body": "The Jones Lab recently received two grants from the National Science Foundation (NSF) valued at about $1.5 million to further research how sexual selection and sexual conflict — which gives rise to different characteristics in males and females ­­— affect the genome. Combined, the studies will last four years.",
   "image": null,
