   "id": "news-79",
   "title": "Adam Jones Awarded $1 Million Comparative Genomics NSF Grant",
   "date": "2020-06-23",
   "body": "Adam Jones, a professor in the Department of Biological Sciences, was awarded a $1 million comparative genomics grant from the National Science Foundation (NSF) to study sexual selection and sexual conflict in pipefish and seahorses over the next four years. He aims to better understand the under-studied relationship between sexual selection and genomes.",
   "image": "content/assets/news/paul-hewart-unsplash-crop.jpg",
