   "id": "news-130",
   "title": "Simulating Colliding Black Holes Using Falcon",
   "date": "2020-03-09",
   "body": "Computational astrophysicist Zachariah Etienne's work on Falcon provides the foundation for our understanding of the black holes and how they orbit.",
   "image": "content/assets/news/gabriele-garanzelli-pzo-citnjdi-unsplash-square.jpg",
